WEBVTT

00:05.580 --> 00:08.040
Ichikawa, do you use LINE?

00:09.130 --> 00:11.880
I-is she poking fun at me?

00:11.880 --> 00:14.630
Even people without friends use LINE, you know!

00:14.630 --> 00:16.960
So what if it's only to text my family?

00:17.880 --> 00:19.630
I-I mean...

00:19.830 --> 00:21.710
I partake a bit.

00:21.960 --> 00:23.330
You make it sound like a drink!

00:26.210 --> 00:28.670
