<b>Recommended official accounts 2</b>

00:28.880 --> 00:29.920
Look!

00:30.960 --> 00:31.500
<b>On the way</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:31.500
<b>What is that?</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:31.500
<b>Kitty Mantis!</b>

00:31.500 --> 00:32.380
<b>On the way</b>

00:32.460 --> 00:34.580
These stickers are hilarious.

00:36.130 --> 00:38.290
Should have guessed they'd be boring.

00:38.290 --> 00:40.710
I could send them to you, if you want.

00:39.080 --> 00:40.290
<b>On the way</b>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.290
<b>What is that?</b>

00:40.710 --> 00:41.960
No, thanks.

00:47.040 --> 00:51.250
O-our class doesn't have a group chat, huh?

00:51.250 --> 00:52.880
Class 2 does.

00:53.170 --> 00:56.130
They're always trying to play themselves off as a team.

00:56.290 --> 00:58.540
The basketball club had one, too.

00:58.540 --> 01:01.380
Speaking of, does the data processing club have one?

01:01.380 --> 01:03.580
Why are we even talking about this?

01:03.790 --> 01:06.750
I don't... think so?

01:06.750 --> 01:09.250
There could be one, maybe I just wasn't invited.

01:09.250 --> 01:11.290
We should ask, then.

01:11.290 --> 01:13.290
What? No, thanks.

01:14.580 --> 01:16.290
W-why, though?

01:16.540 --> 01:17.460
What?

01:22.540 --> 01:27.630
It's such a small club, if they haven't invited me,
it's because they don't want me in it.

01:31.250 --> 01:35.500
Doubt she even knows what it's like to get left out.

03:08.130 --> 03:10.080
<b>December 16th</b>

03:08.920 --> 03:12.460
What I'd do for a boyfriend before Christmas!

03:12.460 --> 03:13.210
Yeah, huh?

03:13.210 --> 03:16.290
Come on, at least give me a "me too."

03:16.290 --> 03:20.080
Whining about wanting one will
never get me one though, I know.

03:20.080 --> 03:22.670
I need to make some actual moves!

03:22.670 --> 03:24.080
What sort of "moves"?

03:25.000 --> 03:27.000
Like... I know!

03:27.000 --> 03:29.670
Exchanging LINE IDs with all the boys in class!

03:30.290 --> 03:32.170
Right. Good luck with that.

03:32.630 --> 03:33.540
Good idea!

03:33.630 --> 03:36.830
Well! Finally on board, are you?

03:37.380 --> 03:41.750
Finding a boyfriend would be as
easy as breathing for Yamada!

03:41.750 --> 03:43.080
Go out with me!

03:43.080 --> 03:44.750
As you wish!

03:46.130 --> 03:47.960
Leave Yamada out of this!

03:48.920 --> 03:49.830
Hey...

03:50.130 --> 03:51.750
Hmm? Huh?

03:51.750 --> 03:53.420
Whoa now, hang on!

03:53.420 --> 03:57.380
Why send a level 99 out to handle slimes?

03:57.380 --> 03:58.540
"Slimes"?

03:58.540 --> 04:01.960
I thought we were exchanging IDs with everyone?

04:01.960 --> 04:04.000
Oh, right. Okay.

04:04.250 --> 04:05.960
Ichi, gimme your LINE ID.

04:06.210 --> 04:07.040
"Ichi..."?

04:08.630 --> 04:10.130
Can I just give you my code?

04:10.130 --> 04:10.750
Here.

04:10.750 --> 04:12.420
Wait, but...

04:14.960 --> 04:16.210
'Kay. There you are.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.290
<b>Kyo</b>

04:16.380 --> 04:19.000
Hey, your prof pic is Rem from Re:Zero.

04:19.000 --> 04:20.500
Wait, you know her?

04:20.500 --> 04:23.750
Yeah, my brother's a real otaku.

04:23.960 --> 04:26.420
I'm more of a Ram fan, myself.

04:26.580 --> 04:30.420
Living proof some gyaru types are nice to nerds.

04:31.750 --> 04:32.540
Hmm?

04:33.040 --> 04:33.670
Huh?

04:34.630 --> 04:36.790
What happened?
What's with that bloodlust...?

04:37.710 --> 04:38.540
'Kay.

04:38.540 --> 04:42.170
At your level you need to handle the higher ups, Anna.

04:42.330 --> 04:43.380
What higher ups?

04:43.500 --> 04:46.830
Like, in this class we've got Ishimuro.

04:47.460 --> 04:49.040
Ishimuro is an average looking guy,

04:49.040 --> 04:52.580
but also track team ace
and one of the brightest in class.

04:52.880 --> 04:54.540
Go ask him!

04:54.540 --> 04:57.170
You're the one who wants his ID, Moe.

04:57.330 --> 04:59.580
Ishimuro lives in the same apartment building as me.

04:59.580 --> 05:00.290
WHA?!

05:00.500 --> 05:02.170
Are you close, then?

05:03.670 --> 05:04.960
Well...

05:05.790 --> 05:06.580
Yeah...

05:08.130 --> 05:10.380
Our parents get along.

05:10.380 --> 05:12.540
We talk sometimes when we see each other.

05:12.630 --> 05:20.250
<b>ROOF</b>

05:12.710 --> 05:15.630
The same apartment? Co-parments?

05:15.630 --> 05:19.920
So they basically live under the same roof?!

05:20.290 --> 05:22.290
Do you already know his LINE ID?

05:22.290 --> 05:23.880
No, actually.

05:23.880 --> 05:25.500
Go get asking, then!

05:25.500 --> 05:26.880
So then, like-

05:27.790 --> 05:29.580
No! Don't!

05:34.880 --> 05:36.710
H-hey, umm...

05:37.380 --> 05:40.460
I have no real reason to stop her, though...

05:40.630 --> 05:42.960
Ichimuro, do you use LINE?

05:43.880 --> 05:45.040
Wait...

05:46.130 --> 05:48.420
Ichikawa, do you use LINE?

05:48.580 --> 05:50.710
Yeah... Why?

05:51.040 --> 05:52.670
Let's exchange IDs.

05:53.210 --> 05:55.080
Was she trying to...?

05:56.750 --> 05:57.670
AH!

05:57.830 --> 05:58.710
Huh?

05:59.380 --> 06:02.670
No, I uhh, just...

06:05.330 --> 06:06.290
Knew that kid was a weirdo.

06:06.290 --> 06:07.130
What's with him?
Knew that kid was a weirdo.<b></b>

06:07.540 --> 06:09.500
Sorry, never mind.

06:09.920 --> 06:13.080
No, chill out, there's no way...

06:13.420 --> 06:14.830
But what if...?

06:15.630 --> 06:18.330
I-I just better make sure to tell her next time.

06:18.580 --> 06:21.500
I do use it! I do! I do! I do!

06:21.500 --> 06:22.540
Yo, Ichikawa.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.330
You ever check if your sys is up to date?

06:24.580 --> 06:25.540
I do!

06:27.000 --> 06:27.750
Wait...

06:28.040 --> 06:30.830
Whoa! You tryna date your sister?!

06:30.830 --> 06:32.460
What a perv! What a perv!

06:32.460 --> 06:34.500
Okay, now pull your mouth wide and say,
"I need to pack!"

06:37.380 --> 06:39.080
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

06:39.630 --> 06:43.250
Yamada was trying to exchange LINE IDs with me...

06:44.460 --> 06:48.000
She's got tons of friends, though.

06:48.250 --> 06:51.210
Exchanging IDs is probably no big deal for her.

06:52.460 --> 06:54.880
Yamada likes guys who are...

06:55.830 --> 06:58.290
...distant and curt,

06:58.290 --> 07:02.380
but really nice under the surface,
kind of charming, a little awkward...

07:02.670 --> 07:04.630
Guys like that don't exist in real life!

07:05.130 --> 07:06.830
Whoa now, settle down.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.670
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

07:13.210 --> 07:16.710
You always hanging 'round like that cuz you like me?

07:17.080 --> 07:21.960
What's this gloomy guy doing talking like that?
What if he's wrong?

07:23.540 --> 07:26.830
He's not though. That's opportunism for you.

07:40.080 --> 07:41.000
Stop...

07:41.920 --> 07:46.040
Gah! No! This train of thought is bad!

07:46.040 --> 07:48.210
Quit giving yourself hope!

07:48.540 --> 07:49.540
Stop!

07:49.580 --> 07:53.080
<b>I never said</b>

07:49.580 --> 07:53.080
<b>I didn't.</b>

07:55.920 --> 08:00.250
Only ended up getting through three pages yesterday...

08:01.250 --> 08:01.920
Hmm?

08:02.000 --> 08:03.750
It's really fun, y'know.

08:03.750 --> 08:05.580
The new Dead or Dead.

08:05.580 --> 08:07.960
Want to come over and go at it sometime, Yamada?

08:07.960 --> 08:10.170
At least try and hide your ulterior motives!

08:10.170 --> 08:13.380
Yamada here only plays Animal Cross-seas

08:13.380 --> 08:14.460
What's that?

08:14.460 --> 08:15.630
You don't even know that...?

08:15.630 --> 08:18.500
Good work, Kobayashi. Keep up that iron defense.

08:18.670 --> 08:19.790
This again?

08:19.790 --> 08:21.880
Who's that, though?

08:22.040 --> 08:23.460
Think that's his girlfriend?

08:23.460 --> 08:28.250
If it was, he wouldn't be going after
Yamada like this, right?

08:28.540 --> 08:31.420
Sure he would, guy's a real polygamist.

08:31.420 --> 08:34.250
You sure know a lot about the creep.

08:34.710 --> 08:36.630
You can come too then, Kobayashi.

08:37.210 --> 08:42.670
I wanted you to, anyway, right from the start.

08:42.920 --> 08:44.250
Seriously?!

08:44.250 --> 08:47.040
Like anyone believes that for a second.

08:47.170 --> 08:48.880
He clearly only cares about Yamada...

08:49.080 --> 08:50.130
REALLY?!

08:50.330 --> 08:51.250
What do you say?

08:51.250 --> 08:55.250
I-I mean... I could go.

08:55.330 --> 08:56.080
Chii?

08:56.210 --> 08:57.750
What a pushover!

08:58.040 --> 08:59.460
There we have it, then.

08:59.460 --> 09:01.960
Feel free to come with, Yamada.

09:01.960 --> 09:04.380
No worries if it's the two of you, right?

09:06.040 --> 09:08.830
This is bad. This is REALLY bad.

09:08.830 --> 09:11.630
Her steel fortress just came crumbling down...

09:12.420 --> 09:14.500
What's with the silent treatment?

09:14.960 --> 09:17.330
I'm not going, you hear?

09:17.330 --> 09:20.080
Fine. I'll just invite Moe, then.

09:20.670 --> 09:22.080
You're really going?

09:22.210 --> 09:24.750
I mean, don't see why not.

09:25.080 --> 09:27.170
It's not gonna be fun.

09:27.170 --> 09:29.250
Well that's not very nice, is it?

09:29.250 --> 09:30.920
Why would you say that?

09:31.080 --> 09:34.710
Yamada's too nice to break it to her that she's only bait.

09:34.710 --> 09:35.290
I mean, that guy's all, you know...
Yamada's too nice to break it to her that she's only bait.<b></b>

09:35.290 --> 09:38.670
I mean, that guy's all, you know...

09:38.670 --> 09:40.130
She's no good at being mean.

09:40.290 --> 09:45.330
Are you trying to bad mouth him?
That's not like you.

09:47.000 --> 09:49.710
Just forget it. But I warned you.

09:50.130 --> 09:51.210
What's your deal?

10:04.750 --> 10:08.460
I really need to find a way to stomp
out Senpai-Pick Up Artist, there...

10:14.670 --> 10:15.830
What's the matter?

10:16.790 --> 10:18.380
N-nothing.

10:18.380 --> 10:21.420
Just thought I might read outside for a change...

10:21.750 --> 10:23.830
She caught me worrying about her.

10:23.830 --> 10:25.170
How pathetic.

10:26.000 --> 10:28.580
Do you play video games, Ichikawa?

10:28.750 --> 10:31.210
I mean, just on Smitch, I guess.

10:31.210 --> 10:33.210
And I only just got that a little ways back...

10:33.830 --> 10:36.880
Tatsuo got a Smitch, y'know!

10:36.880 --> 10:38.960
Already? Awesome!

10:39.380 --> 10:43.710
I played the demo at Yodo,
but the controls were dumb.

10:43.710 --> 10:45.790
That thing's just for casual gamers.

10:46.420 --> 10:49.710
Argh, the memories
I sealed away are coming back to me!

10:49.880 --> 10:51.170
Are you okay?

10:51.170 --> 10:53.580
Ngh, yeah, it's nothing...

10:53.580 --> 10:56.380
My dad plays games,
so we have everything at home.

10:56.380 --> 11:00.210
Smitch, PlaySaturn, and some PC thing, too.

11:00.210 --> 11:01.580
So then...

11:01.580 --> 11:02.250
Huh?

11:02.790 --> 11:04.290
Oh, it's Yamada!

11:05.250 --> 11:06.080
That's the girl...!

11:06.080 --> 11:07.790
My gosh, she's so cute!

11:09.880 --> 11:11.540
Sorry about earlier.

11:11.540 --> 11:12.790
Haruya...

11:12.790 --> 11:16.460
I mean, Nanjo can get a little carried away.

11:16.670 --> 11:18.130
An obvious faux-slip up.
Oh, heh. Is that so?<b></b>

11:18.130 --> 11:19.540
Trying to drive home how buddy-buddy they are.
Oh, heh. Is that so?<b></b>

11:19.540 --> 11:20.750
Trying to drive home how buddy-buddy they are.
Yup!<b></b>

11:20.750 --> 11:24.330
You clearly already have a boyfriend, anyway.

11:24.330 --> 11:26.540
What? No, I don't.

11:26.670 --> 11:28.210
Right, sure.

11:28.210 --> 11:29.960
I-I really don't...

11:31.290 --> 11:37.420
Oh yeah, she's on TV and stuff, so she's gotta pretend.

11:38.750 --> 11:40.460
I really don't have one!

11:43.290 --> 11:44.460
I don't, you know!

11:45.040 --> 11:46.170
Oh...

11:46.710 --> 11:48.000
Huh...

11:49.080 --> 11:49.960
Wait...

11:50.750 --> 11:51.670
Seriously?

11:51.830 --> 11:52.580
Huh?

11:52.750 --> 11:53.250
What?

11:53.250 --> 11:57.710
Nah, nothing. Let's get going. Sorry again!
"Seriously" what? What was she so surprised about?<b></b>

11:57.710 --> 11:59.290
Wait, but... What?!

12:03.710 --> 12:05.500
H-hey, umm...

12:07.330 --> 12:08.380
Yeah?

12:08.380 --> 12:11.960
Y-you shouldn't hang around
me when people are around...

12:12.250 --> 12:13.500
What's this all about?

12:13.500 --> 12:14.670
Just come on.

12:15.170 --> 12:16.330
Senpai-Pick Up Artist?

12:16.580 --> 12:17.460
Shoot!

12:18.210 --> 12:19.080
Huh?

12:25.130 --> 12:27.830
W-w-what...

12:39.710 --> 12:42.420
Hey, Haruya, wait.

12:44.880 --> 12:46.250
U-umm...

12:47.210 --> 12:48.420
Sorry!

12:48.580 --> 12:50.580
L-let's get going...

12:54.830 --> 12:58.710
Okay, so, what was that all about...?

13:02.210 --> 13:07.330
We were supposed to move apart,
getting that close is gonna give people the wrong idea...

13:07.540 --> 13:09.210
Are you kidding me?!

13:09.330 --> 13:10.920
Don't you get it?

13:10.920 --> 13:14.540
BayashiKo, he's just trying to get Anna to come.

13:14.540 --> 13:16.170
You're being used.

13:16.420 --> 13:17.080
Huh?

13:17.080 --> 13:19.500
That guy's a real creep.

13:19.670 --> 13:22.420
No, idiot, that's what's great about him.

13:22.580 --> 13:24.500
I... I...

13:24.830 --> 13:25.670
Kobayashi?

13:25.880 --> 13:30.670
I know. Of course I know!

13:30.790 --> 13:33.000
This is hard to watch.
I mean, I knew from the start! See?<b></b>

13:33.000 --> 13:33.290
I mean, I knew from the start! See?

13:33.290 --> 13:34.290
Right, yeah. 'Course you did.
I mean, I knew from the start! See?<b></b>

13:34.290 --> 13:36.670
I knew, and I said yes anyway,

13:36.670 --> 13:39.130
'cause that's how much it doesn't matter to me, okay?!

13:46.130 --> 13:48.670
H-hey, Yamada...

13:51.000 --> 13:52.920
Hey. You listening?

13:55.630 --> 13:59.790
Yamada. Miss Yamada. Anna. Ann-chan.

14:00.460 --> 14:02.380
Big stupid she-giant!

14:03.630 --> 14:05.000
Get back here!

14:05.000 --> 14:07.170
Wait! How'd you get so fast?!

14:07.630 --> 14:09.960
Oww! Cut it out!

14:14.880 --> 14:15.960
What?

14:17.880 --> 14:23.500
Nothing, just... I decided not to go.

14:26.080 --> 14:29.000
Oh you, what am I going to do with you?

14:29.000 --> 14:31.210
Here we go already...

14:31.500 --> 14:34.040
And so peace returns to the girls...

14:46.080 --> 14:50.040
That guy doesn't really think that we're...

14:50.330 --> 14:52.830
Like me and Yamada are...

14:56.210 --> 14:58.080
No, of course he doesn't.

14:58.330 --> 15:00.920
The only reason me and Yamada were together was...

15:01.580 --> 15:05.130
BayashiKo, he's just trying to get Anna to come.

15:05.460 --> 15:07.630
You're being used.

15:09.380 --> 15:12.460
Was she using me...?

15:14.540 --> 15:15.710
Of course she was...

15:16.710 --> 15:20.750
She used me to shake off a guy who wouldn't take a hint.

15:21.210 --> 15:22.830
Me, a guy she doesn't even like.

15:24.420 --> 15:27.170
Maybe she always has been.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.170
That explains it all.

15:32.210 --> 15:36.290
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

15:39.880 --> 15:42.460
<b>MURDER</b>

15:39.880 --> 15:42.460
<b>ENCYCLOPEDIA</b>

15:42.630 --> 15:43.920
Morning!

15:44.250 --> 15:45.000
Hey.

15:45.000 --> 15:45.750
Mornin'.

15:56.000 --> 15:58.830
I haven't been back to the library since.

15:59.170 --> 16:01.580
Not yesterday. Not the day before, either.

16:02.210 --> 16:04.670
I don't even care anymore.

16:15.580 --> 16:22.080
<b>Year 2 Class 3</b>

16:44.330 --> 16:47.330
Are you mad at me? Why?

16:53.130 --> 16:55.250
I was thinking about going tomorrow!

16:55.250 --> 16:56.580
Come on!

16:57.130 --> 17:00.250
Because I'm always so close?

17:02.210 --> 17:05.420
She's worried about what I said before, huh?

17:06.580 --> 17:07.830
No...

17:10.830 --> 17:12.670
Whatever.

17:13.330 --> 17:16.080
Got places to be, so...

17:18.080 --> 17:19.210
I'm really sorry...

17:20.750 --> 17:22.790
Did she take a hit to her pride?

17:22.790 --> 17:26.630
Upset that the guy she thought
she was using well hates her, now?

17:31.130 --> 17:32.670
<b>Feel free to use</b>

17:40.630 --> 17:43.250
Right, it's so obvious.

17:43.540 --> 17:44.540
Of course...

17:44.790 --> 17:48.130
I knew from the start, didn't I?

17:48.960 --> 17:51.630
That's not the kind of girl Yamada is.

17:58.330 --> 18:02.330
I just wanted an excuse to hate her.

18:04.580 --> 18:08.540
<b>New games now available!</b>

18:04.960 --> 18:07.790
Want me to tell mom you want it?

18:07.790 --> 18:10.380
No. It wasn't even that good.

18:10.380 --> 18:12.540
You played for two whole hours.

18:14.290 --> 18:18.540
I wanted it more than anything,
but knew it was hard to come by...

18:19.290 --> 18:23.040
I was afraid of getting too obsessed...

18:23.750 --> 18:28.000
I just had stuff to do during lunch break...

18:28.380 --> 18:31.080
Really? You're not mad?

18:31.540 --> 18:32.630
Nah...

18:41.080 --> 18:42.250
Sorry...

18:42.250 --> 18:43.710
That was just a hug to make up.

18:43.710 --> 18:45.880
You don't like being close though, do you...

18:48.000 --> 18:50.830
I never said that.

19:03.290 --> 19:05.830
...that cuz you like me?

19:06.920 --> 19:07.880
Shut up.

19:08.330 --> 19:09.580
Away with you.

19:13.210 --> 19:14.750
Let's go home together.

19:15.130 --> 19:16.170
Yeah...

19:18.330 --> 19:22.210
Oh, and do you know the best way to eat natto?

19:22.380 --> 19:24.630
If you stir it round 40 times it's really good-

19:24.630 --> 19:25.670
Sorry.

19:25.920 --> 19:27.830
I'm not big on natto, actually...

19:27.880 --> 19:29.880
Say so sooner, then!

19:29.880 --> 19:31.630
I just went on and on about it.

19:31.750 --> 19:35.040
Yeah, that's why it was hard to say anything.

19:36.250 --> 19:40.830
Me and Yamada really have different senses and tastes.

19:41.710 --> 19:43.130
This is where we split, then.

19:44.210 --> 19:44.880
Wait...

19:45.000 --> 19:45.670
Huh?

19:45.830 --> 19:48.420
Let's... talk some more.

19:48.580 --> 19:51.630
How bad is she hurting to talk about natto?

19:51.920 --> 19:54.290
